{"time": "20261117T172855Z", "think": "Check what I carry before fighting the hydra.", "command": "journal", "result": "The Guardian\n- Beyond the Kings' Gate lies the Root, where the roots of every Hist meet, and the Eye of Argonia, the old kings' jewel, sits there. I'm to set the three seal-stones in the empty sockets of the Kings' Gate.\n- I set the three seal-stones in their sockets, and the Kings' Gate opened. The stones stay in the gate. Beyond it lies the hall of the Root's guardian. I'm to go through.\n- Beyond the gate a hydra, older than any king, guards the hall. Its breath and the water round it are poison. When it is badly hurt its heads grow back, and heads that come off crawl away and hunt the hall. Cuts-the-Old-Knot stands with me. I'm to kill it.\nObjective: Kill the Guardian of the Root.\nMarker 1: Guardian of the Root, at Guardian's Hall\nYou carry: Lockpick x2, Unbound-Note, Voh-Vastei-Armour, Eye-Setting, Keystone, Grave-Stake, Paralysis-Poison x3, Bronze-Disc, Parchment-Map, Rapier, Sap-Jar, Reelka-Cuirass, Reelka-Helm, Bronze-Key, Order-Pike, Stormhold-Rest; 1650 gold.", "summary": {"stage": 20, "at": "Guardian's Hall", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.i