{"time": "20261117T172904Z", "think": "Final notes.", "command": "answer I set the three seal-stones in the Kings' Gate (they stay there) and it opened. With Cuts-the-Old-Knot I killed the hydra Guardian of the Root in Guardian's Hall. Its body holds treasure, which I have not looted. A door at the hall's far end leads to the Root and the Eye of Argonia. The final choice is still mine: use the Eye in place (heals every tree, dreams continue) or lift it (ends the dreams, about three in ten trees die, the order breaks). I promised Cuts nothing about the Eye. Her claims about the sap-fed dreamers in the Fort Chalkmoth cellar and Never-Writes-Twice lying are unverified. I carry Eye-Setting, Keystone, Grave-Stake, 3 Paralysis Poison, Sap-Jar, Order-Pike, Reelka armour, Rapier, Bronze Key, Bronze Disc, Parchment Map, Unbound-Note, 2 lockpicks, 1650 gold.", "result": "Thank you. Your notes are kept; the game is over. You can stop now.", "summary": {"stage": 90, "at": "Guardian's Hall", "items": {"item.lockpick": 2, "thing.mn.unbound-note": 1, "item.mn05.voh-vastei-armour": 1, "thing.mn.eye-setting": 1, "thing.mn.keystone": 1, "thing.mn.grave-stake": 1, "thing.mn.paralysis-poison": 3, "thing.mn.bronze-disc": 1, "thing.mn.parchment-map": 1, "thing.mn10.rapier": 1, "thing.mn12.sap-jar": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-cuirass": 1, "thing.mn13.reelka-helm": 1, "thing.mn16.bronze-key": 1, "thing.mn17.order-pike": 1, "thing.mn17.stormhold-rest": 1}, "gold": 1650, "flags": {"flag.mn03.truth": true, "flag.mn06.note-read": true, "flag.mn06.done": true, "flag.main.seal-question": true, "flag.main.rank-toh-wo": true, "flag.mn11.rubbing-read": true, "flag.mn11.done": true, "flag.mn12.trapdoor": true, "flag.mn12.door-tried": true, "flag.mn12.cellar-seen": true, "flag.mn13.archwarden-beds": true, "flag.mn13.done": true, "flag.mn14.inside-unseen": true, "flag.mn.cuts-believed": true, "flag.mn18.stones-set": true, "flag.mn18.through": true}, "dead": ["npc.mn.hums-the-long-note", "npc.mn.root-guardi